      "writtenOn": "2026-10-28T16:33:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks @alexander.hansen@9elements.com, since keeping the array matches what entity manager publishes and what mctpreactor reads today, I\u0027d lean towards leaving it as `array[uint64]` and switching to `ay` once entity manager can take the D-Bus type from the schema. @andrew@codeconstruct.com.au, would that work for you?",
      "parentUuid": "d630766d_0337aa57",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 25,
        "startChar": 18,
        "endLine": 25,
        "endChar": 24
      },
      "revId": "a7762435d1b9b11e299a98faed5045b0e112d082",
