      "writtenOn": "2026-10-29T16:07:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Thanks for the suggestion. I prototyped an `x-dbus-type` keyword on schema properties, using the type names from phosphor-dbus-interfaces, in https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/entity-manager/+/96528 (validated at build time) and https://gerrit.openbmc.org/c/openbmc/entity-manager/+/96529 (used by entity-manager to convert values when publishing). \nA value like `address` missing its `$` now fails validation instead of being published as a string, and existing output stays the same.",
      "parentUuid": "d9e66ac5_98690fff",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 25,
